WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:09.140
I don't have a single cavity.

2
00:00:09.141 --> 00:00:10.699
Do you want to see?

3
00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:18.591
Ahhh. But my brother Bada already has two cavities.

4
00:00:18.592 --> 00:00:21.198
Bada: I am all finished, Mom.

5
00:00:21.199 --> 00:00:22.649
Mom: Are you really?

6
00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:24.155
Bada: Yes!

7
00:00:24.156 --> 00:00:27.638
Mom: Let me see. Say, ahhh.

8
00:00:27.639 --> 00:00:30.613
Bada, did you brush your back teeth?

9
00:00:30.614 --> 00:00:32.849
Bada: I brushed the front teeth.

10
00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:35.608
Mom: Come on, go back to the bathroom.

11
00:00:35.609 --> 00:00:39.455
Let me brush your teeth.

12
00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:41.244
Mom: Here is the toothpaste.

13
00:00:41.245 --> 00:00:43.244
Don't squeeze too hard.

14
00:00:43.245 --> 00:00:45.217
Mom: Let's get your back teeth.

15
00:00:45.218 --> 00:00:47.763
Brush up and down.

16
00:00:47.764 --> 00:00:49.969
Now, you try.

17
00:00:49.970 --> 00:00:53.885
Bada: Up and down, up and down.

18
00:00:53.886 --> 00:00:55.395
Mom: There you go.

19
00:00:55.396 --> 00:01:00.659
Now, take some water and gargle.

20
00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:04.103
Bada: Okay, am I done now?

21
00:01:04.104 --> 00:01:07.116
Mom: Let's see. Looks good to me.

22
00:01:07.117 --> 00:01:11.103
Mom: Next time, don't forget to brush your back teeth, okay?

23
00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:13.466
Bada: Yes, ma'am.

24
00:01:13.467 --> 00:01:19.089
Come on, Bada, keep brushing up and down, up and down!
